  "body": "### Gameplay\r\n\r\n- Fixed multiple issues with the final boss battle when using more than 4 players, including a softlock when players on the first switch platform would get stuck trying to walk to their destination.\r\n- Fixed spring blocks not working properly with players 5+.\r\n- Fixed the chainlink fences in World 4-Castle not working properly with players 5+, including a softlock when flipped by one.\r\n- Fixed the swinging vines in World 5 and swinging chains in World 8 not working properly with players 5+.\r\n- Fixed a crash in World 6-Airship when players 5+ would come into contact with a spinning gear platform.\r\n- Fixed Mecha Koopas completely ignoring collision with players 5+.\r\n- Fixed a benign stack overflow bug in the tilting girder platforms in World 1-2 when players 7+ are present.\r\n- Fixed the longstanding bug where the camera would zoom out much too far in the boss ending cutscene in World 8-Airship. (#24)\r\n- Fixed a crash in the boss ending cutscene in World 6-Castle when players 5+ are present. (#137)\r\n\r\n### Audio\r\n\r\n- Fixed an issue where the Star BGM would stop if players 1 through 4 all lose their Star power, even if players 5+ continue to have their Star power.\r\n- Fixed an issue where the Yoshi drums would stop if players 1 through 4 all dismount Yoshi, even if players 5+ continue to ride Yoshi.\r\n- Fixed a base game issue where the Yoshi drums would not play if the course starts while riding Yoshi.\r\n\r\n### Technical\r\n\r\n- Added new `end_battles_immediately` debug feature flag, which will cause any boss to die immediately after the battle begins.",
